All culverts and storm sewers shall be constructed of the following materials and meet state department of transportation (DOT) specifications. These specifications are also required to those culvert and storm sewer installations that are connected to the town storm sewer system:
(1) Reinforced concrete pipe (RCP), DOT-approved Class III or better; RCP is required in dams;
